        "command": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "SUBMITVERIFYING",
          "description": "命令类型。\n* SUBMITVERIFYING: 提交审核\n* CONFIRM_ACCEPT:用户确认训练效果\n* CONFIRM_REJECT:用户驳回训练效果\n* CONFIRM_ANSWER:用户答复\n* CONFIRM_PENDING:用户挂起任务\n* CONFIRM_ACTIVE:用户激活任务\n* GET_MULTIPART_UPLOADED:获取训练视频已上传分片信息\n* CONFIRM_REPAIR:用户发起优化模型请求\n* CONFIRM_MULTIPART_UPLOADED:确认训练视频所有分片文件已上传\n* GET_ACTION_VIDEO_MULTIPART_UPLOADED:获取动作编排视频分片上传地址\n* CONFIRM_ACTION_VIDEO_MULTIPART_UPLOADED:确认动作编排视频所有分片文件已上传\n* CONFIRM_AUTHORIZATION_LETTER:确认授权书已上传\n> * CONFIRM_ACCEPT、CONFIRM_REJECT、CONFIRM_ANSWER、CONFIRM_PENDING、CONFIRM_ACTIVE命令仅NA白名单用户可用。\n* DELETE_JOB_VIDEO:删除任务相关视频",
          "enum": [
            "SUBMITVERIFYING",
            "CONFIRM_ACCEPT",
            "CONFIRM_REJECT",
            "CONFIRM_ANSWER",
            "CONFIRM_PENDING",
            "CONFIRM_ACTIVE",
            "GET_MULTIPART_UPLOADED",
            "CONFIRM_REPAIR",
            "CONFIRM_MULTIPART_UPLOADED",
            "GET_ACTION_VIDEO_MULTIPART_UPLOADED",
