          "description": "命令类型:\n* UPDATE_VIDEO: 更新视频\n* UPLOAD_VIDEO: 上传视频\n* CONFIRM_ACTION_VIDEO: 确认动作编排视频\n* GET_ACTION_VIDEO_MULTIPART: 获取动作编排视频分片",
